Svayamprabhā questions rested monkeys about fatigue and errand --- Hanumān begins truthful account --- Rāma enters Daṇḍaka with Lakṣmaṇa and Vaidehī --- Rāvaṇa steals wife from Janasthāna by force --- Sugrīva sends Aṅgada-led monkeys south to seek Rāvaṇa --- Monkeys search south hungry weary despairing --- Monkeys find dark cave disgorging waterbirds and enter hand-in-hand --- Starving monkeys eat hospitality fruits and ask return service --- Svayamprabhā declares pleased needing nothing
